  "title": "Content tree: Retry button for loading errors",
  "product": "Confluence",
  "status": "released",
  "description": "If the content tree fails to load in Confluence, you'll now see an updated error view with a Retry button. This improvement makes it easier to refresh the navigation sidebar without reloading the entire page. To get started with this change: Navigate to any Confluence space.\n\tIf the sidebar fails to load, locate the error message in the content tree area.\n\tSelect Retry to attempt to load your pages and folders again.",
